# Build context of the root Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file, named after
# the Dockerfile, as its ignore list).
# An allowlist: Go sources, vendored modules, the license texts shipped in the
# image, and the assets the binary embeds.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!vendor/
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY.md
!panel/static/
!routing/
**/*_test.go
